---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: Contact
activePage: contact
permalink: /contact/
---

<section class="page-header{% if pageHeaders.contact.photo %} page-header--photo{% endif %}"{% if pageHeaders.contact.photo %} style="background-image:url('{{ pageHeaders.contact.photo }}'); background-position:{{ pageHeaders.contact.photoPosition or 'center' }};"{% endif %}>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p>Have questions or want to get involved? We'd love to hear from you.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    {#- Every contact route appears EXACTLY ONCE on this page. An earlier
       version listed the email address, Instagram and LinkedIn in a left-hand
       list and then repeated all three in the right-hand card, under two
       competing headings ("Get in Touch" / "Send us a message") that invited
       the same action twice.

       The rule that keeps it honest: the primary card holds whichever route
       we most want people to use, and "Other ways to reach us" holds the rest
       — so when a Google contact form is configured the email moves down into
       the list, and when it isn't, the email *is* the primary action and is
       therefore left out of the list below. Check both branches if you edit
       this. #}
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-info">
        <h3>Send us a message</h3>
        {%- if site.contactFormUrl %}
        <p>Whether you're interested in joining the society, competing in The GH Cup or the Mini Moot, or partnering with us — fill in our short contact form and we'll get back to you by email.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ site.contactFormUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the contact form<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
        {%- elif site.email %}
        <p>Whether you're interested in joining the society, competing in The GH Cup or the Mini Moot, or partnering with us — email us and we'll get back to you as soon as we can. We read everything that comes in.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email {{ site.email }}</a>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="contact-cta">
        <h3>Other ways to reach us</h3>
        <p>We post competition news, event dates, and results here first.</p>
        <div class="contact-links">
          <a href="{{ site.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"/><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"/><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"/></svg>
            @ghpls on Instagram
          </a>
          <a href="{{ site.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg>
            LinkedIn
          </a>
          {%- if site.email and site.contactFormUrl %}
          <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M22 7l-10 6L2 7"/></svg>
            {{ site.email }}
          </a>
          {%- endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
